<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμνάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμάζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in 3sg.
			pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμνᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.221
				</span></i>
			: impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.52
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.103
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμνασκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					251
				</span></i>
			: 2sg.
			pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμνᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1388
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.); imper. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			. (These forms may belong orig.to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμνᾱμι,</span>
			
				Aeol.
			 for sq.; <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> also gives pres.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμνει</span> and fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμνήσει.</span>)</div>
